Ensure that every rod in the network has at least 3 edges between ends or junctions, otherwise errors may occur

Known issues: right now, every end must meet a junction, or it will be overwritten. I still need to add a way for the setup to detect an end has been taken care of from the other side.
Logic is not totally set up yet for the junctions. The plan is to basically run kappa calculations starting from every edge until a junction is reached.
The first time a junction is reached, it will be handled by the edge we have travelled over, then ignored the rest of the times.